==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|lamentabilis|lāmentābilis|full of sorrow, mournful; deplorable|lang=la}}, from {{term|lamentor|lāmentor|lament|lang=la}}, from {{term|lamenta|lāmenta|wailing, weeping|lang=la}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Causing [[sorrow]], [[distress]] or [[regret]]; [[deplorable]], [[pitiful]] or [[distressing]].

